{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useIsFetching"},{"type":"text","value":" is an optional hook that returns the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":" of the queries that your application is loading or fetching in the background (useful for app-wide loading indicators)."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useIsFetching } from 'react-query'\n// How many queries are fetching?\nconst isFetching = useIsFetching()\n// How many queries matching the posts prefix are fetching?\nconst isFetchingPosts = useIsFetching(['posts'])","lang":"js"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryKey?: QueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"link","href":"../guides/query-keys","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Query Keys"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"filters?: QueryFilters"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"link","href":"../guides/filters#query-filters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Query Filters"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isFetching: number"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Will be the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":" of the queries that your application is currently loading or fetching in the background."}]}]}]}]}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n`useIsFetching` is an optional hook that returns the `number` of the queries that your application is loading or fetching in the background (useful for app-wide loading indicators).\n\n```js\nimport { useIsFetching } from 'react-query'\n// How many queries are fetching?\nconst isFetching = useIsFetching()\n// How many queries matching the posts prefix are fetching?\nconst isFetchingPosts = useIsFetching(['posts'])\n```\n\n**Options**\n\n- `queryKey?: QueryKey`: [Query Keys](../guides/query-keys)\n- `filters?: QueryFilters`: [Query Filters](../guides/filters#query-filters)\n\n**Returns**\n\n- `isFetching: number`\n  - Will be the `number` of the queries that your application is currently loading or fetching in the background.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useIsFetching\ntitle: useIsFetching\n---\n\n`useIsFetching` is an optional hook that returns the `number` of the queries that your application is loading or fetching in the background (useful for app-wide loading indicators).\n\n```js\nimport { useIsFetching } from 'react-query'\n// How many queries are fetching?\nconst isFetching = useIsFetching()\n// How many queries matching the posts prefix are fetching?\nconst isFetchingPosts = useIsFetching(['posts'])\n```\n\n**Options**\n\n- `queryKey?: QueryKey`: [Query Keys](../guides/query-keys)\n- `filters?: QueryFilters`: [Query Filters](../guides/filters#query-filters)\n\n**Returns**\n\n- `isFetching: number`\n  - Will be the `number` of the queries that your application is currently loading or fetching in the background.\n"}
